    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "a break isnt enough though. even when i sleep i'm just dreaming about the smog and the debt. it's not just being tired, kael. it's like... there's this massive nothingness under everything. i look at the skyline and i just feel like i'm already gone. like i'm just waiting for my body to realize it's already finished.",
