      "content": "\"immediate release\"... you make it sound so simple. like just turning off a light. but it's so heavy, ya know? even thinking about actually doing something feels like too much effort. i'm just so tired of fighting a world that's already decided i don't matter. is there really any other way to find that quiet you're talking about?",
